"https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393723_9364163690316538_1881822928577390435_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=027egZTxzMgQ7kNvwHK-8cG&_nc_oc=AdqjKlnPVQZ5RdoAJJrVkQHpPDE3oifILt-wdPqgzQROKxy4on26cjQ1wvtTn_8Q8XI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRrmWHtFEB732fHkdfvjY2OiJb2_au-Vklvajc8H_YZmQ&oe=6AFC72AB"}, "display_name": "Symphoni", "keywords": ["Conducting", "Maestro", "Wizard", "Magic", "Rhythm"], "long_description": "# Wave Your Wand. Command the Music. Become the Wizard of Symphonies.\nWelcome to **Symphoni**, where you can be a grand musical wizard who breathes new life into classical music. Unlike traditional rhythm games, **Symphoni** lets you conduct, cast spells, and transform reality while grooving to the classics.\n{1043215534309263}{664540836007804}\n\n\n# \ud83c\udfbc Wield the Power of Music\nConduct the symphony with your wand and cast spellbinding portals to the rhythm of classical masterpieces.\n{633925752354407}\n\n# \ud83c\udf0e Step Into Magical Realms\nExperience visually stunning MR transitions as your living room transforms into enchanted symphonic worlds.\n{1017135330244800}\n# \ud83c\udfb5 16 Timeless Masterpieces\nChallenge yourself with Tchaikovsky, Beethoven, and more across three difficulty levels and four magical realms.\n{921407033308625}\n# \ud83d\udd2e Collect Wands & Unlock Crystals\nLevel up your magical abilities, unlock 25 unique achievement crystals, and collect four legendary wands.\n{2753157158218964}{602916329194974}\n# \ud83e\ude84 Master the Magic of Motion\nPlay using **hand-tracking** for an immersive conducting experience, or use **controllers** for precise rhythmic gameplay.\n{1132195501699773}\n# \ud83d\udcdd Symphoni Creator (Coming Soon)\nCompose your own musical challenges and try out **user-generated Symphonies**.\n{971665371137427}\n#  \u2728 Experience the Magic of Music\nWith **16 masterpieces, 3 difficulties, wand collections, collectible crystals, and a custom song editor + free song updates** planned in the near future, get ready to raise your wand and experience the magic of classical music like never before.\n", "short_description": "Welcome to Symphoni, where you can be a grand musical wizard who breathes new life into classical music. Unlike traditional rhythm games, Symphoni lets you conduct, cast spells, and transform reality while grooving tothe classics.\n\nWith 16 masterpieces, 3 difficulties, wand collections, collectible crystals, and a custom song editor + free song updates planned in the near future, get ready to raise your wand and experience the magic of classical music like never before."}]}, "developer_name": "techToy Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://techtoy.studio/symphoni-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "techToy Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://symphoni.games/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28048080161473467"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "980278624261089"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "552713921142520"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "552713921142520"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_t